{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は似顔絵会と\nBLTカレンダーお渡し会が\nありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒のベレー帽にした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方、\nおめでとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー緊張した。\n手が震えた震えた！\n私は生声録音会だったからなー\nああ、懐かしい...\nなので似顔絵会は初だったのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張してた私に\n「大丈夫だよ」と声をかけてくださり\nありがとうございました><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうだったかな。\n上手く描けたかな？\nたくさんお話できたけど、\n絵を描くのには足りなかったー><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ飾ってください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お渡し会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい、みさみさ\nお姉ちゃんたちと一緒でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"J列は深川書店 店長まいまい、\nちょっぴり厳しいみさ先輩、\nそして新人アルバイトまりか\nの設定でやってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つもり。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです♪\n握手会まだかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装って最初から誰が\nどれ着るってきめられてるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃそーよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せてた可愛い毛糸ちゃんや\nレースは何に使うの？？\nリメイクとか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"245回目の記事に作った\nブローチ載ってるので見てください!\nあんな感じでまた作ってみます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男のパーマはどう思います？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれだなーって思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし自分が男なら乃木坂の\nメンバーの誰と付き合う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんかなー！意外⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャベツとレタスと白菜\nどれが一番好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもすき。選べない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度まりかちゃんに\n会いに行っていいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃれってどこから\nはじめたらいいですかね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは挑戦してみよう\nっていう気持ちかな！\n似合う似合わない関係なく\nすきなの着てみよう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日がゆみ姉にとって\n最後のイベントでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみこゆみこゆみこゆみこゆみこ\nゆみこゆみこゆみこゆみこゆみこ\nゆみこゆみこおおおおおおぉぉおお"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？\nハートとか描いてうっとおしい？笑\nだってだいすきなんだもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の似顔絵会でちらっと見たけど\nゆみ姉さすが絵うまい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お渡し会前にみんなで\nパーティーしたんだよ。\nケーキはねねと一緒に運んだよ^^\n花束と、みんなで書いた\nメッセージカードも渡しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思い出たくさんあるな。\n最後までゆみ姉いじりって\n乃木坂らしい＊‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみ姉、本当にお疲れ様でした。\nずーっと応援してる！\nここで終わりじゃない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛してるゆみこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/18/4996064/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもがんばろう！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}